Executive Summary
The economic architecture of PanjoCoin (PNJC) is designed to transform viral meme coin culture into a sustainable, transparent, and socially impactful Web3 ecosystem.
Unlike speculative meme assets lacking infrastructure or long-term utility, PNJC integrates:
•	fixed-supply tokenomics,
•	decentralized governance,
•	staking infrastructure,
•	treasury transparency,
•	gas-optimized dApp interactions,
•	and verifiable charitable financing mechanisms.
The ecosystem is aligned with the decentralized infrastructure of CryptoTengo Hub and focuses on long-term sustainability, ecosystem expansion, community governance, and measurable social impact initiatives, including medical clown therapy programs in M. Iashvili Children's Central Hospital.
