To support long-term sustainability and reduce inflationary pressure, PanjoCoin integrates transparent deflationary mechanics.
Native Burn Mechanism
The immutable burn() function permanently removes tokens from circulation.
Potential burn sources include:
•	unused ecosystem reserves,
•	community-approved burn events,
•	treasury optimization strategies.
________________________________________
Liquidity Stabilization
Treasury reserves may support:
•	liquidity reinforcement,
•	slippage reduction,
•	DEX market stabilization.
________________________________________
On-Chain Transparency
All treasury operations, liquidity activity, and burn transactions remain publicly verifiable through the Polygon blockchain.
